        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://roadsidethoughts.com/mt/maxville-xx-granite-profile.htm"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The community lies just 11 miles north of Philipsburg, a key nearby hub in the Bitterroot Valley.",
